      "en": "This was the workmanship of the lamp stand, beaten work of gold. From its base to its flowers, it was beaten work. He made the lamp stand according to the pattern which the LORD had shown Moses.",
      "ko": "이 등대의 제도는 이러하니 곧 금을 쳐서 만든 것인데 밑판에서 그 꽃까지 쳐서 만든 것이라 모세가 여호와께서 자기에게 보이신 식양을 따라 이 등대를 만들었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "81cf83e69f0d0e24413ad256ddabb4b5320858950b28d1d45439e675c033943b",
      "translation_text_hash": "672143eff7b64b7065922843a23e38dcaff354f6a8b082c22c3e569100308258",
