      "en": "You shall present the Levites before the Tent of Meeting. You shall assemble the whole congregation of the children of Israel.",
      "ko": "레위인을 회막 앞에 나오게 하고 이스라엘 자손의 온 회중을 모으고",
      "source_text_hash": "5e232f23da4e5afded9911e36834141bfc9bd3575ae667e10d3c9256fb05adc8",
      "translation_text_hash": "034438d287dea68ffbd289fde998f3790d276c63b1aa658e1e275671ac6ca275",
