      "en": "“After that, the Levites shall go in to do the service of the Tent of Meeting. You shall cleanse them, and offer them as a wave offering.",
      "ko": "네가 그들을 정결케 하여 요제로 드린 후에 그들이 회막에 들어가서 봉사할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c6f5260b4e61ca15a474962135361fde52904f8717c835dd3d05410bfb30f98c",
      "translation_text_hash": "e37f8062261cda775808c2e09a3cf893b3afcdbd3517e935f818d6fc5af2a609",
